# A 12-level dependency chain. BuildTarget calls itself once per dependency, so
# every level costs one stack frame. Six levels used to exhaust the stack and
# kill the process with no message at all.
#
# Dependency graph: App -> L01 -> L02 -> ... -> L12
Depend ../L01

Assembly DeepChainApp

BuildDirectory        Build
IntermediateDirectory Intermediate

SourceFiles           main
